---
// Landing Page - Minnaar-Matthews Creative House
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Minnaar-Matthews | Creative House</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      /* Responsive Media Adjustments */
      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .site-header {
          padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem !important;
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 1rem;
          text-align: center;
        }
        .hero-content {
          padding: 2rem 1.25rem !important;
        }
        .nav-links {
          gap: 1.25rem !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #F5F2EB; color: #2C2A29; font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow-x: hidden; box-sizing: border-box;">
    
    <!-- Fixed Atmospheric Background Visual with Absolute Edge-to-Edge Coverage -->
    <div style="position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; opacity: 0.15; background-image: url('/hero-bg.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(125%);"></div>

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header class="site-header" style="position: relative; z-index: 10; padding: 2rem 3rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(227, 222, 212, 0.8); background-color: rgba(245, 242, 235, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%;">
      <a href="/" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; letter-spacing: 0.2em; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.125rem); text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">Minnaar-Matthews</a>
      <nav class="nav-links" style="display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center;">
        <a href="/portfolio" style="font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29; text-decoration: none;">Portfolio</a>
        <a href="/contact" style="font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29; text-decoration: none;">Inquiries</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Hero Centerpiece -->
    <main class="hero-content" style="position: relative; z-index: 10; flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center; padding: 4rem 2rem; box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; max-width: 75rem; margin: 0 auto;">
      
      <!-- Brand Subtitle Tag -->
      <span style="font-size: clamp(0.65rem, 1.5vw, 0.75rem); letter-spacing: 0.4em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7A756D; display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Creative House</span>

      <!-- Main Title with Responsive Clamping -->
      <h1 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 4.75rem); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29; margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0; line-height: 1.15;">
        Minnaar-Matthews
      </h1>

      <!-- Decorative Divider Rule -->
      <div style="width: 3.5rem; height: 1px; background-color: #C5BEB0; margin: 0 auto 2rem auto;"></div>

      <!-- Tagline Description -->
      <p style="font-size: clamp(0.875rem, 2vw, 1.05rem); font-weight: 300; color: #5C5750; letter-spacing: 0.08em; max-width: 34rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;">
        Bespoke visual architecture, spatial compositions, and digital experiences crafted with uncompromising precision.
      </p>

      <!-- Action Buttons -->
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;">
        <a href="/portfolio" style="background-color: #2C2A29; color: #F5F2EB; padding: 1rem 2.25rem; font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 0.2s;">
          Explore Works
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" style="background-color: transparent; color: #2C2A29; border: 1px solid #C5BEB0; padding: 1rem 2.25rem; font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s;">
          Get in Touch
        </a>
      </div>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer style="position: relative; z-index: 10; padding: 1.75rem 3rem; text-align: center; font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; border-top: 1px solid #E3DED4; color: #7A756D; background-color: rgba(245, 242, 235, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%;">
      &copy; 2026 Minnaar-Matthews Creative House. All Rights Reserved.
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>